*
!.gitignore
!SOURCE-VERIFIED.json
!IMPLEMENTATION.md
!START-HERE.md
!IntegMultiReg/
!IntegMultiReg/**
IntegMultiReg/src/*.o
IntegMultiReg/src/*.so
IntegMultiReg/src/Makevars
IntegMultiReg/config.log
IntegMultiReg/config.status
!paper/
!paper/*.R
!paper/*.md
!paper/*.tex
!paper/*.bib
!paper/jss.bst
!paper/jss.cls
!paper/reference/
!paper/reference/*.c
!paper/expected-results-0.2.0-paper/
!paper/expected-results-0.2.0-paper/**
!paper/historical-audit/
!paper/historical-audit/**
# paper/data and paper/figures stay untracked. The Biometrics/Wiley supplement
# under paper/data has a different license and distribution boundary from the
# reduced public example shipped as kircIMR, and paper/figures holds generated
# results rather than sources.
!provenance/
!provenance/msi-before-anvil/
!provenance/msi-before-anvil/**
!provenance/original-runners/
!provenance/original-runners/*.R
!hpc/
!hpc/**
!tools/
!tools/*.py
!tools/*.sh
__pycache__/
*.pyc
